{
  "uid": "roseblue",
  "title": "roseblue",
  "description": "Roseblue PAW3395 VIK at 400 CPI, 1:1 cursor movement. USB controller A0DD18E29D278282. Optical panels select PAW3395 series; old PMW3610 history is preserved separately.",
